'''Barnaby Wilikers''', also known as '''Barnaby''', is one of the 4 Minor [[Toons]] in [[Dandy's World]]. He is a toy fish, and he resides inside of {{CI|Finn|name=true}}'s fishbowl head.

====Appearance====
Barnaby is a small purple fish with wiggly light purple stripes on his body and tail, short fins, puckered up lips, purple blush, and large eyes. He has a gray wind-up key on his back.

