====Trivia====
*Barnaby is the first non-{{Type|Main}} [[Toon]] to have a last name, with the second being Mr & Mrs Holloway.
**This could imply that {{CI|Finn|name=true}}'s last name is also Wilikers, since pets tend to take the last name of their owners, though because only Main Character Toons can have last names (with the exception of Mr. and Mrs. Holloway and possibly {{CI|Coal|name=true}}), the last name addition may just be a name-based choice.
*Blot Jr. and Barnaby have [[Stickers]], despite not being actual [[Toons]], though they have their corresponding Toon with them.
*Barnaby is heavily implied to be a sentient [[Toon]] since he can blink and move suspiciously fluid for a toy, as mentioned in one of {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}'s [[Gossip]] dialogues.
**This hints that Finn was right that Barnaby is in fact more than just a toy, in his interaction with {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}.
**Barnaby is most likely a robot, since he can move on his own while still being framed as a toy.
*Akin to Blot Jr., Barnaby changes his appearance depending on [[Finn]]'s [[Skin]].
*Barnaby is the second non-playable Toon since [[Dandy]], followed by Blot Jr. and [[Dyle]]. While Dandy and Dyle are not playable to the public, Barnaby and Blot Jr. are not playable at all.
*Barnaby initially did not have a [[Twisted]] counterpart when he was first revealed, and lacked a counterpart up until [[Changelog|v0.22.1]], which introduced Twisted Barnaby.
*If Finn is extracting from a Barnaby Machine, Barnaby will jump every time the player interacts in the minigame.

