'''Twisted Barnaby''' is currently the only Minor [[Twisted]] in [[Dandy's World]]. He was introduced on June 12th, 2026. He resides in {{CI|Twisted Finn|name=true}}'s head.

====Appearance====
Twisted Barnaby very closely resembles his [[Toon]] counterpart, except for having eyes with red sclerae and having half of his body being completely covered in Ichor, with Ichor tears.

====Mechanic====
When {{CI|Twisted Finn|name=true}} is on the Floor and he creates an [[Ichor Puddle]], there is a chance for Twisted Barnaby to be dropped inside one of these puddles. When a [[Toon]] walks over the puddle, Twisted Barnaby will latch onto that Toon for 10 seconds for a solo run, 15 seconds for 2-4 player runs, and 20 seconds for larger runs. While he is on you, Twisted Finn will be attracted to you, darting towards you until Twisted Barnaby releases with an indefinite attention span. Another Toon is able to pull Twisted Barnaby off of a Toon to prematurely end the chase. Finally, he will drop down into the floor and wait to be dropped into another puddle.

