'''Blot Jr.''' is one of the 4 Minor [[Toons]] in [[Dandy's World]]. He was introduced on May 23, 2025. He can be summoned by Blot for 10 to 80 [[Tapes]], which scales depending on the number of Blots in a round (10 Tapes per Blot).

====Appearance====
Blot Jr. is a gray, limbless ink blob. His head is shaped like [[Blot|his creator]]'s, with the left side of his head having a large drip reaching towards the ground and the right side of his head having a smaller drip that's half the size of the left drip. He has a piece of paper taped to the right side of his head with a drawn-on eye. His stem gradually darkens into black and ends in a small puddle on the ground.

