====Trivia====
*Blot Jr.'s eye drawing is also used as {{CI|Twisted Blot|name=true}}'s pupil.
*There is evidence that Blot Jr. is sentient, just like Barnaby, due to his eye drawing changing expressions as shown in the official doodles, although this is most likely someone like Blot switching the drawing with another similar one.
*{{CI|Twisted Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}}, {{CI|Twisted Rodger|name=true}}, {{CI|Twisted Connie|name=true}}, and [[Twisted Blot]]'s arms won't target or attack Blot Jr. at all.
**Even though [[Twisted Glisten]] will attack Blot Jr., he won't affect his meter while he is passive.
*Ranged Twisteds such as {{CI|Twisted Goob|name=true}} and {{CI|Twisted Scraps|name=true}} can still target Blot Jr.; However, their ranged attacks won't target Blot Jr., delaying them instead. Blot Jr. also can't prevent {{CI|Twisted Gigi|name=true}} from taking items from your inventory.
*{{CI|Twisted Sprout|name=true}} can summon his [[Ichor]] tendril onto Blot Jr., but the tendrils will not kill it.
*Blot Jr. has the lowest [[Stealth]] in [[Dandy's World]], even lower than {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}. Shrimpo, however, still stands as the [[Toon]] with the lowest Stealth, as Blot Jr. is not considered a Toon.
*If correctly positioned, Blot Jr. can be placed in the [[Elevator]] door, and when the door closes, he will still be there.
*In [[Changelog|v0.17.11]], Blot Jr. had been given a Vintage [[Skin]] in order to match with Vintage [[Blot]], which was 276 days after Vintage Blot Jr. was revealed.
*[[Blot]]'s [[Skin]] also corresponds to Blot Jr.
*Blot Jr. and Barnaby have [[Stickers]], despite not being actual [[Toons]], though they have their corresponding Toon with them.
*Blot Jr. and Barnaby are the only [[Toons]] that can't be played with at all in-game, not even in [[Roleplay]] or by the development team.

