{{DialogueQuote|Gourdy|I-I just- the two of them, they were there- they felt so... so... familiar|[[Gourdy]] mentioning his parents in his [[Gossip]] on [[Astro]]}}

Mr and Mrs Holloway are 2 of the 4 minor [[Toons]]. They are {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}'s parents and are absent in [[Gardenview]] due to [[Arthur]] deeming them "not commercially viable" for being stern in children's eyes and Delilah talking about "removing" them after she created them early and Arthur cancelled them. This left Gourdy with mere memories of them, only being portrayed through drawings.

It is certain Gourdy is unable to even remember their appearances, as seen in drawings where Gourdy scribbles out his parents' faces for not looking right. His {{TI|Memory Locket|name=true}}, some of his & his {{CI|Twisted Gourdy}}[[Twisted Gourdy|Twisted counterpart]]'s dialogue and his drawings in his bedroom all express his huge desire to remember what they look like, but nothing else is known about them.

====Appearances====
=====Mr Holloway=====
Mr Holloway's head is elongated and at the top he has a stem and two leaves, giving him a middle part. He has large paws for hands and feet, with 4 claws on each hand and three on his feet, and a long spindly tail, with a leaf at the end of it. His head, torso, and hands are dark orange, while his arms, legs, claws, and tail are green. His mouth is a zigzag, akin to the mouths of jack-o-lanterns.

=====Mrs Holloway=====
At the top of her head (which is shaped like her son's), Mrs Holloway has a stem and 2 leaves, one facing out, one falling on her face. She has large paws for hands, with four claws on each hand, stick legs, and a purple bandanna with dark purple spirals. Her head, torso, and hands are a pale tan, while her arms, legs, claws, and tail are dark green.

