====Trivia====
*They are the second non-{{Type|Main}} [[Toons]] to have a last name due to their relation to {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}, with the first being Barnaby Wilikers.
**{{CI|Connie|name=true}} used to have a last name, but Boolynski was changed to her real first name in the game's official sources, since only [[Main Characters]] can have last names.
*[[Gourdy]] inherits his parents' traits, taking:
**His father's hand and feet paws, mouth shape, and the light green claws, tail leaf color, and arms.
**His mother's head shape, tail color, and feet type.
**Both of their body colors, making a lighter shade of orange.
**Both of their stem leaves and leg colors with them being a light to dark green gradient.
**The only trait not inherited was the stem leaf amount being 1 instead of 2, though likely due to his youth.
*[[Gourdy]] seems to have forgotten his mother's tail, color, and paws.
*[[Gourdy]]'s parents are the first [[Toons]] and characters in general to be in a confirmed romantic relationship.
**They are also the second Toons to have an offspring, with the first being {{CI|Blot|name=true}}, who has Blot Jr.
*As seen in the lore tape and "Found in the Woods" animation, [[Gourdy]]'s parents were not deemed viable for creation by [[Arthur]], but [[Delilah]] had turned them into living Toons ahead of schedule, so she proposed a "removal" to be in line with the [[show]].
**"Removing" Gourdy's parents likely meant murdering their real life Toon counterparts. Arthur's furious response to Delilah's abrupt, impulsive actions supports this. It could also be likely that "removal" was said to censor "kill".
**They were deemed commercially unviable due to audiences complaining about how frequently they intervened with Gourdy's life to deliver repetitive advice. The declaration was likely made last-minute, as there is a painting of their heads in what is likely their bedroom.
*With the Lost Prince Plushie and a redesigned {{TI|Memory Locket|name=true}} to match it, this technically gives Mr and Mrs Holloway a [[Skin]].
*Mr & Mrs Holloway were created in the year 1991 around August, before being removed somewhere between August 13 and October 1, 1991.
**How long it took for [[Gourdy]] to become aware of his parents' nonexistence is unclear. 

