===Trivia===
*Julia is the only child who created two works.
*Despite all the children having individual identities, the drawings all appear to look as though the same child drew and wrote various different things due to the overall art style.
*Going off of the drawings that only have or mention children, [[Dandy]] and [[Astro]] are the only two who received two drawings each.

